Rules/Damage/cold/Phrase: Kälteschaden
Rules/Damage/fire: Feuer
Rules/Damage/fire/Phrase: Feuerschaden
Rules/Damage/force: Energie
Rules/Damage/force/Phrase: Energieschaden
Rules/Damage/lightning: Blitz
Rules/Damage/lightning/Phrase: Blitzschaden
Rules/Damage/necrotic: Nekrotisch
Rules/Damage/necrotic/Phrase: nekrotischer Schaden
